      "statement": "openwiki/ documentation pages are regenerated by the scheduled `.github/workflows/openwiki-update.yml` GitHub Actions workflow, which runs weekly on Sundays at 08:00 UTC (cron `0 8 * * 0`) or on manual workflow_dispatch, executes `openwiki code --update --print`, and opens a PR on branch `openwiki/update` covering paths openwiki, AGENTS.md, and CLAUDE.md.",
